 "dialogue": [
  {
   "speaker": "Jane",
   "en": "What's Ron Marston like, Pauline?",
   "zh": "波琳，朗·马斯顿是怎样一个人？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 7,
    "end": 11.5
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "He's awful!",
   "zh": "他讨厌透了！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 11.5,
    "end": 13.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "He telephoned me four times yesterday, and three times the day before yesterday.",
   "zh": "他昨天给我打了 4 次电话，前天打了 3 次。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 13.2,
    "end": 21
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "He telephoned the office yesterday morning and yesterday afternoon.",
   "zh": "他昨天上午和下午把电话打到了我的办公室，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 21,
    "end": 27.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "My boss answered the telephone.",
   "zh": "是我的老板接的。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 27.1,
    "end": 30.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Jane",
   "en": "What did your boss say to him?",
   "zh": "你老板是怎么对他说的？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 30.8,
    "end": 34.3
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "He said, 'Pauline is typing letters.",
   "zh": "他说：“波琳正在打信，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 34.3,
    "end": 37.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "She can't speak to you now!'",
   "zh": "她现在不能同你讲话！”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 37.8,
    "end": 40.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "Then I arrived home at six o'clock yesterday evening.",
   "zh": "后来，我昨晚 6 点钟回到家里。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 40.8,
    "end": 45
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "He telephoned again.",
   "zh": "他又打来电话，",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 45,
    "end": 47
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "But I didn't answer the phone!",
   "zh": "但我没接。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 47,
    "end": 50.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Jane",
   "en": "Did he telephone again last night?",
   "zh": "他昨天夜里又打电话了吗？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 50.2,
    "end": 53.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "Yes, he did.",
   "zh": "是的，打了。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 53.4,
    "end": 55.1
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "He telephoned at nine o'clock.",
   "zh": "他在 9 点钟又打来了电话。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 55.1,
    "end": 58.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Jane",
   "en": "What did you say to him?",
   "zh": "你对他怎么说的？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 58.8,
    "end": 61.4
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "I said, 'This is Pauline's mother.",
   "zh": "我说：“我是波琳的母亲。",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 61.4,
    "end": 65.2
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "Please don't telephone my daughter again!'",
   "zh": "请不要再给我女儿打电话了！”",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 65.2,
    "end": 68.6
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Jane",
   "en": "Did he telephone again?",
   "zh": "他又打了没有？",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 68.6,
    "end": 70.8
   }
  },
  {
   "speaker": "Pauline",
   "en": "No, he didn't!",
   "zh": "没有！",
   "audio": {
    "file": "media/L071.mp4",
    "start": 70.8,
    "end": 74.2
   }
  }
 ],
